      "id": "s1",
      "concept": "Define corrosion",
      "narration": "Corrosion is a natural process where metals degrade due to chemical or electrochemical reactions with their environment. For example, iron rusts when exposed to water and oxygen. This degradation leads to loss of material and structural integrity over time.",
